 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Koi Hajime wa Ochi Yuku Tsubaki no Shita de"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "恋い初めは落ちゆく椿の下で"
   },
   {
    "en": "Love Begins Under the Falling Camellias"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Haruichi Azuma lost his parents in an accident and was left on his own. He was treated coldly and betrayed by the relatives who took him in. One day, an old friend of his father's invites him to his house to take care of his daughter. However, what awaits him is Tsubaki, the second daughter of the Yaotome family, who is selfish and arrogant. He is fed up with this type of person, but like Haruichi, Tsubaki also has loneliness in her eyes.",
   "ja": "事故で両親を失い、天涯孤独となった東 春一は、引き取られた先の親戚から冷遇され、裏切られ、受難の日々を送っていた。そんなある日、父親の旧友から“娘の世話係”として家に招かれる。待っていたのは、わがまま放題なお嬢様・椿。尊大な態度の椿に辟易する春一だったが彼女もまた義母や使用人に虐げられ、目に孤独を宿していて――…"
  },
